#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:69
msgid ""
"Modify one or more attributes of the font. With no arguments, return a "
"dictionary of the current attributes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:72
msgid ":meth:`config` is an alias of :meth:`!configure`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.font.rst:76
msgid ""
"Return a distinct copy of the current font: a new named font with the "
"same attributes but a different name, which can be reconfigured "
"independently of the original. If the current font wraps a font "
"description, the copy is instead a named font with its resolved "
"attributes."
